  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/prismic-components (npm)",
  "details": "The package @ornikar/prismic-components@0.0.8 runs a preinstall hook that downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js) at install time. The payload is compiled/obfuscated, and the download-and-execute pattern at install time with an opaque payload is a known supply-chain attack vector. The package name impersonates the Ornikar brand (@ornikar/*) and has no repository or documentation.",
